      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T16:46:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In-person conversations revealed that Maciej has already spoken with a partner who is bypassing the security requirements and has worked through several alternative approaches with them. This will help reinforce the requirements as we enable sched_ext, and can always be deprecated (if we have an alternative approach down the road) as this switch will be toggled by the mainline connectivity module that can be updated.",
